WEBVTT

00:02:59.884 --> 00:03:02.136
or your Roblox avatar to Fortnite.

00:03:02.678 --> 00:03:05.556
To achieve that, we need
content portability,

00:03:05.598 --> 00:03:08.643
which is a very difficult
engineering task,

00:03:08.684 --> 00:03:11.437
one that requires an object to function

00:03:11.479 --> 00:03:15.399
and look consistently across different
software environments.

00:03:16.275 --> 00:03:17.443
But guess what?

00:03:17.485 --> 00:03:19.570
It's also a lawyering problem

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:22.323
because you need
a complex structure of contracts

00:03:22.365 --> 00:03:24.492
to legally copy a digital object.

00:03:26.118 --> 00:03:27.536
Just between ourselves,

00:03:27.536 --> 00:03:30.665
let me tell you a little
intellectual property secret.